rate fact group maps in the rate the customer group to which the consumption periods apply.\n\nYou make these settings in Customizing for Contract Billing under {Billing Master Data > Rate Structure 3.\n\nProcedure\n\nCompleteness of Data to be Billed\nTo ensure that all consumption and demand is billed, make sure the following applies:\n\ne The periods in the time-of-use interface do not contain any gaps. That is, all season types are alloated to day groups and\nthe day group covers 24 hours.\n\ne Inthe periods to which formulas are allocated, the corresponding result parameters exist for the output parameters of the\nformulas.\n\ne The appropriate RTP operands exist for all result parameters.\n\ne The appropriate rate steps exist for all RTP operands.\n\nDefinition of Result Parameters from Inteface as Operand Values\n\n",
